> Is there any way to speed up Gehennom?  Remember I have only 12 Int, so
> magic mapping is not an option unless I get a lot of scrolls.

As i said above, intelligence isn't the problem here.

At 23 Wis (18 Wis and +5 helm of brilliance) at Xp:30, you'd have 80%
fail. With a robe, that'd still be 43%. A successful casting would
cost 25 power points, a failed casting still costs 12. In short, it's
probably easiest to not even bother with the spell.

Scrolls of magic mapping among the cheapest to write, if you happen to
have a magic marker or two. Clairvoyance can also help a lot if you
just want to find the next staircase fast.

